<title>POLAND: EFEKT SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>EFEKT SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.80 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.35 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.10 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    2.40 vs   1.32</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.54 vs   2.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.66 vs   4.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.86 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Sales		   13.22 vs  10.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Korporacaja</p>
<p>Gospodarcza Efekt SA. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
